    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d12">

                <pb facs="0028" n="14" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p1/pg14"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.6363/5–848: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Legation in Saudi Arabia
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret   us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-05-08T11:00:00-04:00">May 8, 1948—11 a.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>171. Pls make clear to SAG that USG feels the question of extent to which Aramco
                    concession covers submerged Persian Gulf area is matter for determination
                    between SAG and Aramco. USG and UKG consultations not addressed to this problem
                    but confined to formulating applicable principles governing division Persian
                    Gulf submerged area (among countries having adjacent territory) with view to
                    fair and orderly exploitation. These principles will be submitted to SAG when
                    formulated.</p>
                <p>Sent Jidda, repeated London.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
